<https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonerge/etu-cap/m7/f9> a kademe:Birim ;
    eli:is_part_of <https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonerge/etu-cap/m7> ;
    kademe:birimTipi "fikra" ;
