<https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonerge/etu-ortak-egitim/m32/f3/bb> a kademe:Birim ;
    eli:is_part_of <https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonerge/etu-ortak-egitim/m32/f3> ;
