<https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonetmelik/15287/m21/f5> a kademe:Birim ;
    eli:is_part_of <https://w3id.org/kademe/id/yonetmelik/15287/m21> ;
    kademe:birimTipi "fikra" ;
